TError"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"DefaultError.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DefaultError"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of errors your mutation function may throw."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tvariables","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TVariables"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TVariables"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of the variable passed to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutate"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tonmutateresult","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TOnMutateResult"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOnMutateResult"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type returned by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onMutate"},{"type":"text","value":", passed to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSuccess"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onError"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSettled"},{"type":"text","value":" as\ntheir "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onMutateResult"},{"type":"text","value":" parameter — useful for optimistic-update rollback data."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"args","children":[{"type":"text","value":"args"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"..."},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Parameters"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"MutateFunction.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MutateFunction"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TVariables"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOnMutateResult"},{"type":"text","value":">>"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3},{"id":"tvariables","text":"TVariables","level":3},{"id":"tonmutateresult","text":"TOnMutateResult","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"args","text":"args","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype UseMutateFunction<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult> = (...args: Parameters<MutateFunction<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>>) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/solid-query/src/types.ts:276](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/solid-query/src/types.ts#L276)\n\nThe type of `mutate`, as returned by `useMutation`. Forwards the variables (and an optional per-call\n`onSuccess`/`onError`/`onSettled`) to the underlying `mutate` call. Fire-and-forget — errors are surfaced\nthrough the mutation result instead of being thrown by `mutate`, unless `throwOnError` makes `useMutation`\nrethrow them.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type your mutation function resolves to.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your mutation function may throw.\n\n### TVariables\n\n`TVariables` = `void`\n\nThe type of the variable passed to `mutate`.\n\n### TOnMutateResult\n\n`TOnMutateResult` = `unknown`\n\nThe type returned by `onMutate`, passed to `onSuccess`/`onError`/`onSettled` as\ntheir `onMutateResult` parameter — useful for optimistic-update rollback data.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### args\n\n...`Parameters`\\<[`MutateFunction`](MutateFunction.md)\\<`TData`, `TError`, `TVariables`, `TOnMutateResult`\\>\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: UseMutateFunction\ntitle: UseMutateFunction\n---\n\n```ts\ntype UseMutateFunction<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult> = (...args: Parameters<MutateFunction<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>>) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/solid-query/src/types.ts:276](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/solid-query/src/types.ts#L276)\n\nThe type of `mutate`, as returned by `useMutation`. Forwards the variables (and an optional per-call\n`onSuccess`/`onError`/`onSettled`) to the underlying `mutate` call. Fire-and-forget — errors are surfaced\nthrough the mutation result instead of being thrown by `mutate`, unless `throwOnError` makes `useMutation`\nrethrow them.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type your mutation function resolves to.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your mutation function may throw.\n\n### TVariables\n\n`TVariables` = `void`\n\nThe type of the variable passed to `mutate`.\n\n### TOnMutateResult\n\n`TOnMutateResult` = `unknown`\n\nThe type returned by `onMutate`, passed to `onSuccess`/`onError`/`onSettled` as\ntheir `onMutateResult` parameter — useful for optimistic-update rollback data.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### args\n\n...`Parameters`\\<[`MutateFunction`](MutateFunction.md)\\<`TData`, `TError`, `TVariables`, `TOnMutateResult`\\>\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n"}
